{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":3,"title":"행렬의 행별 합","desc":"<p>행렬 <code>m</code>의 <b>각 행의 합</b>을 벡터로 돌려주는 <code>row_totals(m)</code>를 만드세요. (행이 2개 이상인 행렬만 나와요)</p><p>행렬은 <code>matrix(1:6, nrow = 2)</code> 처럼 만들고, 값은 <b>열 방향</b>으로 채워져요.</p>","solution":"row_totals <- function(m) {\n  unname(rowSums(m))\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>rowSums()</code>는 행별 합이에요. 열별은 <code>colSums()</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"row_totals(matrix(1:6, nrow = 2))","expected":[9,12],"visible":true},{"call":"row_totals(matrix(1, 2, 2))","expected":[2,2],"visible":true},{"call":"row_totals(matrix(1:4, 2, byrow = TRUE))","expected":[3,7],"visible":false},{"call":"row_totals(matrix(1:6, 3))","expected":[5,7,9],"visible":false}],"starter":"row_totals <- function(m) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-339"}